[{"id": "2114825728055234668", "text": "Lamine Yamal \u2013 3 consecutive Kopa Trophies (record)\nVicky Lopez - 2 consecutive Kopa Trophies (record)\n\n\ud835\udc0c\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc03\ud835\udc04 \ud835\udc08\ud835\udc0d \ud835\udc0b\ud835\udc00 \ud835\udc0c\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc12\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc00! \u2764", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVleyuQXQAIDoOy.jpg"}, {"id": "2114826817349517641", "text": "\ud835\udc13\ud835\udc21\ud835\udc1e \ud835\udc01\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc12\ud835\udc13  \ud835\udc32\u0336\ud835\udc28\u0336\ud835\udc2e\u0336\ud835\udc27\u0336\u0336\ud835\udc20\u0336 \ud835\udc29\ud835\udc25\ud835\udc1a\ud835\udc32\ud835\udc1e\ud835\udc2b \ud835\udc22\ud835\udc27 \ud835\udc2d\ud835\udc21\ud835\udc1e \ud835\udc30\ud835\udc28\ud835\udc2b\ud835\udc25\ud835\udc1d \u2b50", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVlfyCWXgAAp-Qq.jpg"}, {"id": "2114827223786041539", "text": "\u2757\ufe0f| \ud835\udc02\ud835\udc11\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc19\ud835\udc18 \ud835\udc05\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc02\ud835\udc13: Barcelona players have won 5 of the 6 Kopa Trophies awarded since the award was introduced. \ud835\udc0b\ud835\udc1a \ud835\udc0c\ud835\udc1a\ud835\udc2c\ud835\udc22\ud835\udc1a! \ud83d\ude35", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVlgJxLWMAAwz1p.jpg"}, {"id": "2114827375540060284", "text": "\ud83d\udea8| \ud835\udc0e\ud835\udc05\ud835\udc05\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc02\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc0b: The TOP 10 rankings for the 2026 Kopa Trophy!\n\n\ud83e\udd47 Lamine Yamal\n\ud83e\udd48 Pau Cubars\u00ed\n\ud83e\udd49 Warren Za\u00efre-Emery\n4\ufe0f\u20e3 Lennart Karl\n5\ufe0f\u20e3 Yan Diomand\u00e9\n6\ufe0f\u20e3 Ayyoub Bouaddi\n7\ufe0f\u20e3 Kerim Alajbegovi\u0107\n8\ufe0f\u20e3 Eli Junior Kroupi\n9\ufe0f\u20e3 Ibrahim Maza\n\ud83d\udd1f Johan Manzambi\n\n#fcblive #BallonDOr \ud83c\udf15", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2114827703622705633", "text": "\ud83d\udea8| \ud835\udc0e\ud835\udc05\ud835\udc05\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc02\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc0b: Bar\u00e7a Femeni coach Pere Romeu WINS the Best Women's Football Coach award at the 2026 Ballon D'Or. #fcblive \ud83d\udc4f", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVlglteXYAAD1wM.jpg"}, {"id": "2114830195832062152", "text": "\ud83d\udea8| \ud835\udc01\ud835\udc11\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc0a\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc0d\ud835\udc06: Luis de la Fuente has been named as Men's Coach of the Year at the 2026 Ballon D'Or.\n\nWell deserved! \ud83d\udc4f\ud83c\uddea\ud83c\uddf8", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVli2v0WMAAhuY6.jpg"}, {"id": "2114833099062128910", "text": "Barcelona and Spain sweeping up everything so far at the #BallonDOr.\n\nCata Coll wins the Women's Best Goalkeeper award and Unai Simon wins the Men's Best Goalkeeper award. \ud83c\udf15\ud83e\udde4", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2114835650688020657", "text": "Triple sweep \u2705", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVln0QIWsAEZcGz.jpg"}, {"id": "2114840482450698645", "text": "\ud83d\udea8\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f| Joan Laporta: \"I feel we are the CANDIDATES to win this season's champions league.\" #fcblive", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVlsNiTWsAIbiPt.jpg"}, {"id": "2114840936454783166", "text": "Time really does fly. \ud83e\udd79\u2764\ufe0f", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVlsn7HXgAA3i_h.jpg"}, {"id": "2114842789363978543", "text": "Yamal x Vozinha \ud83c\uddea\ud83c\uddf8\ud83c\udde8\ud83c\uddfb", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVluT2GWoAAbwBz.jpg"}, {"id": "2114849672535916689", "text": "\ud83d\udea8\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f| Alexia Putellas: \u201cI want to dedicate this award to FC Barcelona and all my family and friends.\u201d #fcblive", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVl0ebfbwAAhQJL.jpg"}, {"id": "2114850001214152850", "text": "\ud835\udc0b\ud835\udc00 \ud835\udc11\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc0d\ud835\udc00, forever \ud83d\udc78", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVl0ziibsAAZyqB.jpg"}, {"id": "2114852454080651506", "text": "\ud83d\udea8| \ud835\udc01\ud835\udc11\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc0a\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc0d\ud835\udc06: Harry Kane is the 2026 Men's Ballon D'Or WINNER. \ud83c\udf15\n\nCongratulations!", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVl3GXxWgAAJ7D9.jpg"}, {"id": "2114853006365647169", "text": "We will be back next year \u2764", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVl3mhoWIAAtsow.jpg"}, {"id": "2114853756193919362", "text": "\ud83d\udea8| \ud835\udc01\ud835\udc11\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc0a\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc0d\ud835\udc06: Lamine Yamal finished THIRD in the Ballon D'Or rankings, behind Mbappe. \ud83c\udf15\u274c", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVl4SIGXMAAEc3U.jpg"}, {"id": "2114856120225321087", "text": "\ud83d\udea8\ud83d\udcf2 | Ferm\u00edn on IG:", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVl6byVXUAAhSPr.jpg"}, {"id": "2114860438005395512", "text": "\ud83d\udea8\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f| Laporta: \u201cLamine has sufficiently proven his merits to be the Ballon d\u2019Or winner, but it couldn\u2019t happen.\u201d #fcblive", "media_type": "video", "media_url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2114858240181678081/vid/avc1/1920x1080/2AyV3BYvI6oJwdZs.mp4?tag=16"}, {"id": "2114866371641196867", "text": "Travelled all the way from Madrid to London only to watch others pick up all the awards. \ud83d\ude02", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVmDwhbXQAArAnV.jpg"}, {"id": "2114984536178110612", "text": "\ud835\udc06\ud835\udc28\ud835\udc28\ud835\udc1d \ud835\udc0c\ud835\udc28\ud835\udc2b\ud835\udc27\ud835\udc22\ud835\udc27\ud835\udc20 \ud835\udc02\ud835\udc2e\ud835\udc25\ud835\udc1e\ud835\udc2b\ud835\udc2c \ud83d\udc10", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVnvOkNX0AE7KQ_.jpg"}, {"id": "2114985473810505909", "text": "\ud83d\udea8\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f| Vincent Garcia (Editor-in-chief of France football): \"I think that Rodri took some votes away from Lamine in the race.\u201d #fcblive", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVnwFMUWQAAFD9V.jpg"}, {"id": "2115021462721442271", "text": "\u2757| \ud835\udc11\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc0c\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc0d\ud835\udc03\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc11: Bar\u00e7a will return to training tomorrow. #fcblive", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVoQ0AKXQAAWP3F.jpg"}, {"id": "2115024248368406959", "text": "\ud83d\udea8\ud83d\udcf2 | Raphinha liked this REEL on Insta which says: \u201cThey gave Ballon D'Or to Kane but Raphinha was put fifth last season despite having a similar case.\u201d", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVoTWJuW8AAPzNa.jpg"}, {"id": "2115024546604454345", "text": "\ud835\udc13\ud835\udc07\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc0d & \ud835\udc0d\ud835\udc0e\ud835\udc16, he's a constant \ud83d\udc10", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVoTnfqXoAAWIRW.jpg"}, {"id": "2115026862283825556", "text": "\ud83d\udea8\ud83c\udf96| \ud835\udc09\ud835\udc14\ud835\udc12\ud835\udc13 \ud835\udc08\ud835\udc0d: Hansi Flick is considering Brian Fari\u00f1as to cover Xavi Espart\u2019s absence at right-back position. [@gbsans] #fcblive", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVoVuTkWEAAjDKU.jpg"}, {"id": "2115034320859459776", "text": "Meanwhile Ter Stegen Vs Sparta \ud83d\udd25\ud83c\udde9\ud83c\uddea", "media_type": "video", "media_url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2115034141461008384/vid/avc1/720x1280/j8dVCd4TfRqPrjPZ.mp4?tag=29"}, {"id": "2115039183525834978", "text": "\ud83d\udea8| \ud835\udc0e\ud835\udc05\ud835\udc05\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc02\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc0b: LaLiga have unveiled the winter ball for the 2026/27 season. #fcblive \u2744\ufe0f\u26bd", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVog7eUWwAAhgOb.jpg"}, {"id": "2115064073599521176", "text": "\ud83d\udcf2 | Pedro Porro on IG: N1\u2764\ufe0f Lamine", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVo3kP5XIAArwFg.jpg"}, {"id": "2115087599068975168", "text": "\ud83d\udea8 | \ud835\udc0b\ud835\udc0e\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc0d \ud835\udc16\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc13\ud835\udc02\ud835\udc07: Araujo is the @premierleague Player of the Matchweek. #fcblive \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddfe", "media_type": "video", "media_url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2115065984234991616/vid/avc1/1080x1350/5V0kPGlXkDocyQaO.mp4?tag=16"}, {"id": "2115104201386623178", "text": "\ud83d\udea8\ud83d\udcf2 | Xavi Espart on IG: Sad for the defeat, with only one idea in mind: to come back as soon as possible, the better. They can't handle us. For\u00e7a Bar\u00e7a! \ud83d\udc99\u2764\ufe0f", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVpcD6TW4AAw8ca.jpg"}]